{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108220","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910822001:1":{"text":"浅海……是什么样子？是不是……水很暖和，很明亮？是不是有很多食物，不会饿肚子？","source_cn":"浅海……是什么样子？是不是……水很暖和，很明亮？是不是...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x50E8B5129C1AE390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910822002:1":{"text":"有很多很多家人……都住在一起。真的吗？","source_cn":"有很多很多家人……都住在一起。真的吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB6144291B3397D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910822003:1":{"text":"嗯，浅海很美、很明亮、很暖和，也有很多好吃的，大家生活在一起，是整个海里最好最好的地方。","source_cn":"嗯，浅海很美、很明亮、很暖和，也有很多好吃的，大家生活...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1FF9A95B0E3BF8E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910822004:1":{"text":"哥哥也是这样讲给我听的。他说，要让我去一个很大、很漂亮的地方生活。","source_cn":"哥哥也是这样讲给我听的。他说，要让我去一个很大、很漂亮...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x49B7CEB50AC3286B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910822005:1":{"text":"거기 가면 더는 아프지 않고, 그 소리에도 시달리지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"在那里，你会好起来，不再生病，不再受声音的折磨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCACBD6EA4CB2161A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910822006:1":{"text":"형, 나 괜찮아. 집에 가고 싶어... 집에 가자.","source_cn":"哥哥，我没关系的，我想回家……我们回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FBF84B1B7D07689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910822007:1":{"text":"소리는 좀 약해졌어?","source_cn":"你听到的声音变弱了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FDDA96BE06E2226","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910822008:1":{"text":"아니... 아주 선명하게 계속 들려.","source_cn":"不……它一直都在，我听得很清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE7C938FBFEDB952","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910822009:1":{"text":"하지만 형... 내 걱정은 안 해도 돼.","source_cn":"但是哥哥……你不用再担心我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBD47A313DD1C34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910822010:1":{"text":"什么？","source_cn":"什么？","status":"ambiguous_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910822011:1":{"text":"이미 집에 돌아왔으니까.","source_cn":"因为我到家了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18A2A870A5C5DD63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910822012:1":{"text":"가네트?","source_cn":"歌尼特？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8AA4B67F9059B9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910822013:1":{"text":"아니, 이건 뭔가 잘못됐어...","source_cn":"不，这不对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE810B10E2A5B43F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910822014:1":{"text":"형, 걱정 마. 난 이미 내가 태어난 곳이자 모든 것의 시작점으로 돌아왔어.","source_cn":"哥哥，安心吧，我已经回到了我诞生的地方，一切的起点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CEB8A2B4166CA93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910822015:1":{"text":"무서워하지 마, 형. 형도 이제 집으로 돌아올 거야.","source_cn":"不要害怕，哥哥，你也要回家了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3167932DB0E24EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910822016:1":{"text":"나에게 손을 주렴. 동생과 다시 만나고 난 뒤에는...","source_cn":"把你的手给我，与你的弟弟团聚，然后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F495ED9217253FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910822017:1":{"text":" ...내가 되는 거란다.","source_cn":"……成为我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC634C54589F616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910822018:1":{"text":"편히 잠들거라. 사랑하는 나의 일부이자 강인한 조각아.","source_cn":"安宁地睡吧，亲爱的我，坚韧的碎片。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D7A32FDF3CEA76D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910822019:1":{"text":"좋은 꿈 꾸렴.","source_cn":"做个好梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7969283901480EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:歌尼特":{"text":"가네트","source":"歌尼特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:艾菲拉":{"text":"엘피라","source":"艾菲拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡律":{"text":"칼릭스","source":"卡律","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥汐娜":{"text":"오세아나","source":"奥汐娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":4}}